title Klondike: the dock labels and the HUD at the board's density (480x800 at 741 px per 100 mm), nothing clipped
sizes 480x800
ppmm 741
env KLONDIKE_TEST_DATA u-dock-board-portrait
env KLONDIKE_TEST_RESET 1
env KLONDIKE_TEST_DEAL 7
env KLONDIKE_TEST_LABELS 1
wait 300
shot table
check table
expect text "Undo"
expect text "Redo"
expect text "Menu"
expect notext "LABELCLIP"
